  "title": "Knockout Fresh Russian Beef Biryani",
  "description": "A hearty Russian dish featuring chopped chive and infused oil, perfect for a spring morning hangover cure. This raw-friendly biryani is made with fresh ingredients and is sure to satisfy your cravings.",
