  "instructions": [
    "Heat the infused oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the beef strips and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the diced carrot and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped chive, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the cooked rice, frozen peas, and beef strips to the skillet, stirring to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional chopped chive if desired."
